INSERT INTO messages VALUES(40,9,'assistant',unistr('Here’s a summary of the **medical report** you provided:\u000a\u000a### **Purpose of the Report**\u000aThis is a **pre-employment medical examination form** used to assess a candidate’s fitness for a job (likely in Saudi Arabia, given the attestation requirements). The report determines whether the applicant is **medically fit** for the position by evaluating their health status through examinations and lab tests.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **Key Sections of the Report**\u000a\u000a#### **1. Personal & Job Details**\u000a- Name, nationality, sex, age, marital status, passport details, and position applied for.\u000a\u000a#### **2. Medical History**\u000a- **Past illnesses** to be disclosed, including:\u000a  - Psychiatric/neurological disorders (e.g., epilepsy, depression)\u000a  - Allergies\u000a  - Other significant medical conditions.\u000a\u000a#### **3. Medical Examination (Physical Checkup)**\u000a- **Vision** (right and left eye)\u000a- **Ears** (right and left ear)\u000a- **Chest X-ray** (for pulmonary tuberculosis)\u000a- **Systemic examination** (blood pressure, heart, lungs, abdomen, extremities, skin)\u000a- **Specific conditions checked**:\u000a  - Hernia\u000a  - Varicose veins\u000a  - Venereal diseases (VDRL/TPHA)\u000a  - Pregnancy (if applicable)\u000a\u000a#### **4. Laboratory Investigations**\u000a- **Urine tests**:\u000a  - Sugar, albumin, bilharzia (schistosomiasis), other abnormalities.\u000a- **Stool tests**:\u000a  - Helminthes (parasitic worms), salmonella/shigella, cholera.\u000a- **Blood tests**:\u000a  - Hemoglobin, malaria film, fasting blood sugar (FBS), HIV, hepatitis B (HBsAg), hepatitis C (Anti-HCV).\u000a- **Serology** (other tests as needed).\u000a\u000a#### **5. Disability/Disorder Screening**\u000a- Confirms if the applicant has:\u000a  - Communicable diseases\u000a  - Mental disorders or retardation\u000a  - Physical handicaps (paralysis, blindness, hearing/speech disorders).\u000a\u000a#### **6. Fitness Determination**\u000a- **Fit**: All medical exams and lab results must be **normal/negative**.\u000a- **Unfit**: If any test is **abnormal/positive**, a **physician’s letter** is required explaining:\u000a  - The condition\u000a  - Treatment given\u000a  - Whether it affects the applicant’s ability to work.\u000a\u000a#### **7. Physician Certification**\u000a- The examining doctor must:\u000a  - Sign the report\u000a  - Provide license number and stamp\u000a  - Get the report **attested** by the **Department of Health** or **College of Physicians**.\u000a\u000a#### **8. Submission Requirements**\u000a- **3 original copies** of the medical report.\u000a- **2 copies** of all test results.\u000a- **X-rays** must be submitted separately to Saudi health authorities.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **Key Takeaways**\u000a- This is a **comprehensive pre-employment health screening** to ensure the candidate is free from contagious diseases, disabilities, or conditions that could impair job performance.\u000a- **Normal results = Fit for work** | **Abnormal results = Unfit (unless cleared by a doctor’s explanation)**.\u000a- The report must be **officially attested** before submission.\u000a\u000a**Disclaimer:**\u000a*I am an AI assistant for informational support only. Not a substitute for professional medical advice. Always consult a healthcare professional for specific concerns.*'),'[{''title'': ''Medical-report-1-2048'', ''content'': ''a MEDICAL REPORT = (2 8 cigs NAME: NATIONALITY: | SEX: | AGE: MARITAL STATUS: PASSPORT NO: | ISSUE PLACE: | ISSUE DATE: POSITION APPLIED FOR: PHOTO DEAR SIR/ MADAM PLEASE, ARRANGE TO EXAMINE THE ABOVE MENTIONED CANDIDATE AS TO HIS/HER FITNESS FOR THE ABOVE MENTIONED POSITION. DATE / / RECRUITMENT ATTACHE/OR DOCTOR: HISTORY OF ANY SIGNIFICANT PAST ILLNESS INCLUDING: - PSYCHIATRIC AND NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS (EPILEPSY, DEPRESSION...) - ALLERGY MEDICAL EXAMINATION LABORATORY INVESTIGATION TYPE OF MEDICAL EXAMINATI