INSERT INTO messages VALUES(50,11,'assistant',unistr('I am an AI assistant for informational support only. **Not a substitute for professional medical advice.** Always consult a healthcare professional for urgent medical concerns.\u000a\u000aIf you''re in **India** and experiencing **persistent headaches with vomiting**, here are some of the **top hospitals** known for **neurology, emergency care, and general medicine** across major cities. These hospitals have **24/7 emergency services, advanced diagnostic facilities (CT/MRI scans), and specialist doctors** for conditions like migraines, infections, or neurological issues.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **🏥 Top Hospitals in India for Headache & Vomiting (Neurology/Emergency Care)**\u000a\u000a#### **📍 Delhi/NCR**\u000a1. **All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS), New Delhi**\u000a   - **Best for:** Neurology, emergency care, government-subsidized treatment\u000a   - **Specialties:** Headache clinics, stroke units, infectious disease departments\u000a   - **Emergency:** 24/7 trauma & emergency services\u000a   - **Website:** [www.aiims.edu](https://www.aiims.edu)\u000a\u000a2. **Fortis Memorial Research Institute (FMRI), Gurgaon**\u000a   - **Best for:** Advanced neurology, private care\u000a   - **Specialties:** Migraine clinics, neuroimaging (MRI/CT), emergency medicine\u000a   - **Emergency:** 24/7 with critical care units\u000a   - **Website:** [www.fortishealthcare.com](https://www.fortishealthcare.com)\u000a\u000a3. **Max Super Speciality Hospital, Saket (Delhi)**\u000a   - **Best for:** Neurology, gastroenterology (for vomiting causes)\u000a   - **Specialties:** Headache management, infectious disease, emergency care\u000a   - **Website:** [www.maxhealthcare.in](https://www.maxhealthcare.in)\u000a\u000a4. **Indraprastha Apollo Hospitals, Delhi**\u000a   - **Best for:** Comprehensive emergency & neurology care\u000a   - **Specialties:** Stroke units, migraine treatment, 24/7 emergency\u000a   - **Websit