INSERT INTO messages VALUES(105,22,'user','can you suggest me some tablets for this problem and tell the side effects of the tablet also.','','2026-07-29 09:05:35.841299');
INSERT INTO messages VALUES(106,22,'assistant',unistr('I **cannot prescribe or recommend specific medications**, as this requires a personalized evaluation by a healthcare professional (e.g., Emily’s cardiologist). However, I can provide **general information** about common medications used for conditions like hers (hypertension, possible coronary artery disease, or angina) and their potential side effects.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **Common Medications for Emily’s Symptoms**\u000a*(Based on her history of hypertension, chest pain on exertion, and palpitations)*\u000a\u000a#### **1. For Hypertension & Chest Pain (Angina)**\u000a**A. Beta-Blockers** (e.g., Metoprolol, Atenolol, Carvedilol)\u000a- **Purpose:** Reduce heart rate, lower blood pressure, and decrease oxygen demand on the heart.\u000a- **Side Effects:**\u000a  - Fatigue, dizziness, or lightheadedness.\u000a  - Cold hands/feet.\u000a  - Slow heart rate (bradycardia).\u000a  - Worsening of asthma/COPD (if applicable).\u000a  - Erectile dysfunction (rare).\u000a\u000a**B. Calcium Channel Blockers** (e.g., Amlodipine, Diltiazem, Verapamil)\u000a- **Purpose:** Relax blood vessels, improve blood flow, and reduce chest pain.\u000a- **Side Effects:**\u000a  - Swelling in ankles/feet (edema).\u000a  - Headache, dizziness.\u000a  - Flushing (redness in face).\u000a  - Constipation (especially with Verapamil).\u000a  - Rapid heart rate (with some types).\u000a\u000a**C. ACE Inhibitors** (e.g., Lisinopril, Ramipril) or **ARBs** (e.g., Losartan, Valsartan)\u000a- **Purpose:** Lower blood pressure and protect the heart/kidneys.\u000a- **Side Effects (ACE Inhibitors):**\u000a  - Dry cough (common).\u000a  - Dizziness, headache.\u000a  - High potassium levels (hyperkalemia).\u000a  - Rare: Swelling of face/lips (angioedema).\u000a- **Side Effects (ARBs):**\u000a  - Similar to ACE inhibitors but **no cough**.\u000a  - Dizziness, back pain.\u000a\u000a**D. Nitrates** (e.g., Nitroglycerin sublingual tablets/spray)\u000a- **Purpose:** Quick relief for chest pain (angina) by widening blood vessels.\u000a- **Side Effects:**\u000a  - Headache (very common).\u000a  - Dizziness, flushing.\u000a  - Low blood pressure (hypotension).\u000a  - Rapid heart rate.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a#### **2. For Palpitations (If Arrhythmia is Suspected)**\u000a**A. Antiarrhythmics** (e.g., Flecainide, Amiodarone)\u000a- **Purpose:** Control irregular heartbeats.\u000a- **Side Effects (Amiodarone):**\u000a  - Lung toxicity (long-term use).\u000a  - Thyroid problems.\u000a  - Skin sensitivity to sunlight.\u000a  - Liver enzyme changes.\u000a- **Side Effects (Flecainide):**\u000a  - Dizziness, blurred vision.\u000a  - Worsening of heart failure (in some cases).\u000a\u000a**B. Low-Dose Aspirin** (if coronary artery disease is confirmed)\u000a- **Purpose:** Prevent blood clots.\u000a- **Side Effects:**\u000a  - Stomach irritation/ulcers.\u000a  - Increased bleeding risk.\u000a  - Allergic reactions (rare).\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **Important Notes:**\u000a1. **Do NOT self-medicate.** Emily’s doctor will choose medications based on:\u000a   - Her **blood pressure levels**.\u000a   - **Test results** (e.g., ECG, stress test, echocardiogram).\u000a   - **Other health conditions** (e.g., diabetes, kidney disease).\u000a   - **Drug interactions** (e.g., with her current hypertension meds).\u000a\u000a2. **Lifestyle Adjustments** (equally important):\u000a   - Reduce salt intake.\u000a   - Regular moderate exercise (as advised by her doctor).\u000a   - Stress management (e.g., meditation, yoga).\u000a   - Avoid caffeine/alcohol if they trigger palpitations.\u000a\u000a3. **When to Seek Emergency Care:**\u000a   - Chest pain lasting **>5 minutes** or worsening.\u000a   - Severe shortness of breath.\u000a   - Fainting or extreme dizziness.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a*I am an AI assistant for informational support only. Not a substitute for professional medical advice. Always consult Emily’s cardiologist or healthcare provider for personalized treatment.*'),'[{''title'': ''images-2'', ''content'': ''Patient Information Form Name: Date: Wendi your problem stat?; __escibe Probe Cause of Current Problem: (D caracdent Cl Woskinuy CO Gaduatonset other Did this Problem require Surgery: No Cl Yes 0 YesDateot surgery ast Medical History Oo youhaveaisry fhe fosoning problems? 2 Breathing Pblems D Seok 2 Depression Pregnant 1D BonajeintPeblems Bowed C1 Heat mebiems 1D Kidney Prabiems Wir then aol we G CanentWoundskinPrebems ©) Galbaddener Og ute Pacemaker 1 ectrclimpant © smoing 1 Tmoucancer sity atch: Headaches C Oisbete 1D Seep Apnea 1D NoSurgeries SugeniesMospeaations ver Complains 1D NoMedicaton Medications Peselt Medations that you ae taking eda) Dove FawsonorMeseaton TT No Keown allergies Allergies latex Ove Ome Todine Ove Ne Bromine Ws Cl no other Do you have anyreigiousicltrlvews that wil affect your treatment?” No Over ‘tional commentieading or Memory Problem) Signature bate'', ''relevance_score'': 0.7797287391052314, ''source'': ''image:images-2.png''}, {''title'': ''images-2'', ''content'': ''Patient Information Form Name: Date: Wendi your problem stat?; __escibe Probe Cause of Current Problem: (D caracdent Cl Woskinuy CO Gaduatonset other Did this Problem require Surgery: No Cl Yes 0 YesDateot surgery ast Medical History Oo youhaveaisry fhe fosoning problems? 2 Breathing Pblems D Seok 2 Depression Pregnant 1D BonajeintPeblems Bowed C1 Heat mebiems 1D Kidney Prabiems Wir then aol we G CanentWoundskinPrebems ©) Galbaddener Og ute Pacemaker 1 ectrclimpant © smoing 1 Tmoucancer sity atch: Headaches C Oisbete 1D Seep Apnea 1D NoSurgeries SugeniesMospeaations ver Complains 1D NoMedicaton Medications Peselt Medations that you ae taking eda) Dove FawsonorMeseaton TT No Keown allergies Allergies latex Ove Ome Todine Ove Ne Bromine Ws Cl no other Do you have anyreigiousicltrlvews that wil affect your treatment?” No Over ‘tional commentieading or Memory Problem) Signature bate'', 