INSERT INTO messages VALUES(115,24,'user','Psychiatric and Anti-Anxiety Tablets','','2026-07-29 09:59:20.486255');
INSERT INTO messages VALUES(116,24,'assistant',unistr('Here’s a general overview of **psychiatric and anti-anxiety medications**, their types, uses, and considerations:\u000a\u000a### **1. Anti-Anxiety Medications (Anxiolytics)**\u000aThese are prescribed to manage anxiety disorders, panic attacks, and short-term stress. Common classes include:\u000a\u000a- **Benzodiazepines** (e.g., *Alprazolam/Xanax, Diazepam/Valium, Lorazepam/Ativan*)\u000a  - Fast-acting but risk dependence; typically used short-term.\u000a  - Side effects: Drowsiness, dizziness, memory issues.\u000a\u000a- **SSRIs/SNRIs** (e.g., *Sertraline/Zoloft, Escitalopram/Lexapro, Venlafaxine/Effexor*)\u000a  - First-line for long-term anxiety/depression; take weeks to work.\u000a  - Side effects: Nausea, insomnia, sexual dysfunction.\u000a\u000a- **Buspirone (Buspar)**\u000a  - Non-addictive, slower onset; used for generalized anxiety.\u000a\u000a- **Beta-Blockers** (e.g., *Propranolol*)\u000a  - Reduce physical symptoms (e.g., racing heart) in performance anxiety.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **2. Psychiatric Medications (Other Classes)**\u000a- **Antidepressants** (SSRIs, SNRIs, TCAs, MAOIs)\u000a  - Treat depression, OCD, PTSD, and some anxiety disorders.\u000a  - Example: *Fluoxetine/Prozac, Duloxetine/Cymbalta*.\u000a\u000a- **Antipsychotics** (e.g., *Quetiapine/Seroquel, Aripiprazole/Abilify*)\u000a  - Used for schizophrenia, bipolar disorder, or treatment-resistant depression.\u000a  - Side effects: Weight gain, metabolic changes.\u000a\u000a- **Mood Stabilizers** (e.g., *Lithium, Valproate/Depakote*)\u000a  - Manage bipolar disorder or mood swings.\u000a\u000a---\u000a\u000a### **Key Considerations**\u000a- **Never stop abruptly** (especially benzodiazepines/antidepressants) due to withdrawal risks.\u000a- **Side effects vary**—consult a doctor to balance benefits vs. risks.\u000a- **Therapy + medication** often works best for long-term management.\u000a\u000a**Important:** I am an AI assistant 